{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "1c5bd5121ca10c985bbce29fc18946ccf7d17b8141b8bf1aa2f16395e1fd4a2b", "ja": "Readyイベントライブ！", "zh": "Ready活动巡演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2131b6e5094f1dc62ed1b8a669ee8b542734e31652570c90141e959e68eaac10", "ja": "ユニットメンバーは亜利沙、律子、ひなた、\n美奈子に決定。DVDの特典として練習風景\nを収録すると説明するプロデューサー。撮影\nを任された亜利沙は、大量シャッターチャン\nスの予感にテンションが上がってしまった。", "zh": "组合成员确定为亚利沙、律子、日向、美奈子。\n制作人说明将把练习花絮收录为DVD特典。\n负责拍摄的亚利沙预感会有大量按下快门的机会，\n不禁兴奋起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1caef24a34191a0ce38c11512b18eb5147a26627604a937f8c0b044d8541d68", "ja": "（翌日、改めて4人を集め、\n企画の説明をする事になった。そして……）", "zh": "（第二天，我们再次召集了4人，准备说明企划。然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "085c946f477255f6e6b2961a7a6ddc57c8e418e7f4976a9ebb64098e010f6102", "ja": "と、内容はこんな感じだ。この野外音楽会場での\nイベント公演を、4人に頼みたいと思ってる。", "zh": "大概就是这样。我想把在这个户外音乐会场举办的活动演出，交给4个人来负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "c48160521bc7a2bea9349e8975ea6c13fde8ebe0ac5baaea5e3818ab51e03b81", "ja": "それに加えて、DVD特典としてユニットの練習風景を\n収録……なるほど、いいじゃないですか！", "zh": "除此之外，还可以把组合的练习花絮作为DVD特典收录……原来如此，这不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "c5820508cf6378fe2b62e3e76a1ac328045327f7f7c12d9997bf3bd84461f4d5", "ja": "イベントってことは、ファンの人達以外にも\n見てもらえるわけですし。チャンスだと思いますよ。", "zh": "既然是活动，除了粉丝之外，也能让其他人看到。这可是个机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "cdae75c28ca9be655d7afec31b00c62fd1b897f5048090891c7fad98e6072a49", "ja": "練習中を撮られるのは、ちょっこし恥ずかしいけども。\nみんながよろこんでくれるなら、がんばるべさ！", "zh": "虽然练习的时候被拍下来，还是有点不好意思。不过只要大家开心，我就会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "8f18351f6d4cbd3d563c683a924b826273b940a2836e394cf69461adb6a14402", "ja": "おまけだったら、やっぱり大盛……\nいえ、特盛じゃなくっちゃ！　私も賛成です！", "zh": "要是附赠的话，果然还是得加大份……不，必须是特大份才行！我也赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d150ba8d0ec51f1fbcb6e76d89b28de9f6e6972c9b58bf4153038677ced7b04", "ja": "おお、みんな好感触だな。\nいい返事がもらえてよかったよ。", "zh": "哦，大家的反响都不错嘛。\n能得到满意的答复，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "9d9379c07da80976c7f628bc3a0af536067891272d7ea5c45e073a8727253448", "ja": "ふっふっふ……！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "4730aa1ef83869d3cd45cff3335ac5c1acb6677d26d67a7eb5c5ad0c88ee2d87", "ja": "つまりこの企画、ありさに特典映像の撮影をすべて\nまかせてもらえる……というコトでいいんですね！？", "zh": "也就是说，这次企划的特典影像拍摄全部交给亚利沙负责……可以这么理解吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee800a3214055fd4a7ba64c5c92d32c185152844d6ba41c7fe3f5a3a27b7ee84", "ja": "一言もそんな事は言ってないけど……\nただこの中なら、亜利沙が適任だとは思ってるよ。", "zh": "我可一句都没这么说过……不过在这些人里，我确实觉得亚利沙最合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "7310ff24a30eec742ed6a7b0ed64432bfb69f345df74feb1b797e4cb96a7c202", "ja": "おまかせください！　ここにいるみんなを、\nありさが丸裸にしちゃいますよぉ～！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "交给我吧！在场的各位，就由我来把你们扒个精光哦～！呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d011350832d3ab462b429921f4727ee5bf460c0fed9703d8472cde111de13eb", "ja": "あら。亜利沙、ずいぶん余裕があるみたいね？", "zh": "哎呀。亚利沙，看起来挺游刃有余的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "2ca06fa4144f714ac7da0037dcb7eba1b9906ddf8de974cc7a7db275f14bf279", "ja": "言っておくけど、特典の撮影だけじゃなくて、\n亜利沙もステージに立つ事を忘れずに。", "zh": "先说清楚，不光是特典拍摄，亚利沙你上台演出这件事也别忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "27bc8c680c39196d1828006ef243a069bab6c55d6dfc1f8c1287b160fb4ab61e", "ja": "そ、それはもちろんです！\n特典撮影もレッスンも、全力を尽くします！", "zh": "那、那当然了！\n无论是特典拍摄还是训练，我都会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d75278a22a4dbe4ba0341878a9ad832c271ff5d27efc4101e37dd2ef32acc2de", "ja": "それから……今回はイベント公演だろ？\n何か、普段と違う演出ができないかと考えてるんだ。", "zh": "而且……这次是活动公演吧？\n我在想，能不能安排一些和平时不一样的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b58f5448bb5217bb131db19323715c6f48f9189b2f31b6af616f06ce55f527d2", "ja": "初見のお客さんはもちろんだけど、劇場のお客さんにも\n『イベントに来てよかった』と思って欲しいからな。", "zh": "不只是第一次来的客人，我也希望剧场的观众能觉得“来参加这次活动真是太好了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "c9e82a1c2807ec59254bfa3539250306fe0dc4a323348cc0a8fc3b791b50496d", "ja": "どっちのお客さんも同じように盛り上げろって……\n無茶言いますね、{$P$}殿？", "zh": "竟然要求把两边的观众都同样调动起来……您这不是强人所难吗，{$P$}大人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "0264d5c6048ff9599d502caf9659332ae0ff69b012d5ff6f13eff883d657b950", "ja": "でも、ステージが思いっきり盛り上がれば、\nみんな私達に興味を持ってくれるかもしれませんよね！", "zh": "不过，只要让舞台气氛彻底热闹起来，说不定大家就会对我们产生兴趣了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "26a171a0fe731a8945bc9ae2cefc5c01f550607ef0bd1f218e70964247a06eba", "ja": "強力なライブをして、アイドルちゃん沼にハマって\nもらおうってコトですね！　素晴らしい作戦です♪", "zh": "用一场震撼的演出，把大家拉进偶像妹妹们的\n大坑里对吧！真是绝妙的作战♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "e6a9b388e71bec2b855e953afe7bc549c55752aa554982fbfb530942f47ff880", "ja": "ええっ！？　沼に……！？\nそ、そんなの危ないんじゃないかい……？", "zh": "诶诶！？要陷进去……！？\n那、那样不会很危险吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "4cc243ad213a0fafe541fc447cd8fe22ce978dc5065f977c9e8009221ea4ff21", "ja": "大丈夫よ、ひなた。なんていうか……\nそう、本物の沼じゃなくて、比喩だから。", "zh": "没事的，日向。该怎么说呢……\n对，不是真正的沼泽，只是个比喻啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "47781304f47858947638120faba47d4604fd7cdfd142d8f0054e20e1b3869232", "ja": "そ、そうなのかい？\nでも、なんだか責任重大だねぇ……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n不过，总觉得责任重大呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "40b8ef9ce3810b827d7a42957af62ea07c465e4d18b2b1c1f32ff5eb0793ceba", "ja": "そんなに重く考えなくて大丈夫だよ。何かステージを\n盛り上げるアイディアがあれば、というだけだから。", "zh": "不用想得那么严重，没关系的。只是想问问有没有什么能让舞台热闹起来的点子而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "2959b03fb0787b79665b6a7bbf06335fe52587105351c1ac364a9692f2c1bc01", "ja": "そうだ！　私が出張版佐竹飯店を開いて、\n炒飯や担々麺を振る舞っちゃいましょうか？", "zh": "对了！不如开一家流动版的佐竹饭店，给大家做炒饭和担担面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "01c9ed1e5900bc69b5b4ba9fda753642442a52af92d7196ace37e2e2135ae0f8", "ja": "それだと、765プロの宣伝より、\n佐竹飯店の宣伝になっちゃうんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "那样的话，比起宣传765Pro，反而会变成宣传佐竹饭店了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "c72cdb29cb545ad9a29c0b1658a02175a0be1c8c905d8165c13607045028b169", "ja": "そっか。それに、劇場じゃなくて外の会場ですもんね。\n握手会とか、撮影会もダメってことですか？", "zh": "这样啊。而且场地也不是剧场，而是在外面。也就是说，握手会和合影会之类的也不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "10cc6b6dd9c42a53ed285f5107d76b587b7e4a854b8cf2ab32634be496d63fff", "ja": "そうなるな。通常のレッスンもあるから、\nみんなの負担にならない範囲でいいんだけど。", "zh": "确实是这样。因为还要进行平时的训练，所以在不给大家增加负担的范围内就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f10f42aeaf4cf9556c90e3df9899511542b2fa1d680977513846185a567ccf68", "ja": "盛り上げ方については、もう少し考えるとして……\nひとまず、レッスンを進めよう。みんな、よろしくな！", "zh": "至于如何调动气氛，就再考虑一下吧……\n总之，先继续练习。大家，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_02_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
